<title>SPAIN: BBV 5-mo net attributable up 27.5 pct.</title>
<headline>BBV 5-mo net attributable up 27.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spain's Banco Bilbao Vizcaya (BBV) in the five months to end-May, (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net attributable profit		  48.12  up   27.5 pct</p>
<p> Pretax profit		 more than 105.00  vs   n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: BBV also said it approved a three-for-one share split which will take place on July 19.</p>
</text>
